BaseItemCode,ProductStory
AAFN4S16AG4,"Upgrade your fan's speed control and stop using those clunky, hard-to-reach fan cords. Now you can adjust the speed of your ceiling fan quietly, and in style, thanks to the adorne Collection.This fan speed control switch features four speed settings and a sleek on/off switch. Use on its own to control a fan from one location, or pair with a 3-way switch and conveniently control a single fan from two locations.This switch* features enduring MicrobanÂ® antimicrobial technology that works to reduce the growth of bacteria, around the clock, for the lifespan of the product.* Existing inventory of switches, dimmers and plastic wall plates from the adorneÂ® Collection at some partner locations may not yet include MicrobanÂ® protection. To confirm that a specific Legrand product is protected with MicrobanÂ®, check that the exterior of the product packaging includes a green dot or a """"Protected with Microban"""" label.Made exclusively for use with screwless Wall Plates from the adorneÂ® Collection, sold separately.No antimicrobial efficacy claims are being made or are valid with respect to products sold in Canada."
